# Meta Ads Reporting Automation

Automated Meta Ads campaign reporting system using:

* Meta Marketing API
* Google Sheets
* WhatsApp API
* Python Automation

This project fetches yesterday’s Meta Ads campaign performance data and automatically:

* Stores reports in Google Sheets
* Sends campaign summaries via WhatsApp
* Tracks campaign-level performance
* Supports Leads, CTWA, Awareness, Video & Engagement campaigns

---

# Features

## Campaign Reporting

Automatically fetches:

* Campaign Name
* Results
* Reach
* Impressions
* Cost Per Result
* Amount Spent

---

## Supports Multiple Campaign Types

### Lead Campaigns

* Lead Ads
* Instant Forms
* Website Leads

### WhatsApp / CTWA Campaigns

* Messaging Campaigns
* Conversation Started
* Engagement Campaigns

### Awareness Campaigns

* Video Views
* ThruPlays
* Engagement

### Traffic Campaigns

* Link Clicks
* Landing Page Views

---

# Tech Stack

* Python
* Meta Marketing API
* Google Sheets API
* WhatsApp API
* gspread
* Facebook Business SDK

